1
00:00:00,051 --> 00:00:02,541
(Leonard:)Not mad at the elves at all.

2
00:00:03,788 --> 00:00:05,308
(Leonard:)Open it.

3
00:00:06,057 --> 00:00:07,717
Okay. Ahem.

4
00:00:07,893 --> 00:00:11,723
"An examination of the economic,
cultural and political roots of slavery...

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:15,760
...in the Old South, 1619 to 1865."

6
00:00:17,569 --> 00:00:19,299
(Penny:)What the hell is this?

7
00:00:19,938 --> 00:00:22,738
Don't ask me, a little elf did it. Ha, ha.

8
00:00:24,943 --> 00:00:26,313
(Penny:)So let me get this straight.

9
00:00:26,511 --> 00:00:30,241
(Penny:)You just assumed my paper would be bad,
so you wrote one for me?

10
00:00:30,448 --> 00:00:33,648
(Leonard:)- I assumed it would be good. Then I read it.
- What?

11
00:00:34,819 --> 00:00:38,809
Well, I mean, it was good. There were just
a few things that needed a little polishing.

12
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:42,520
- Well, you changed every word.
- That's not true. Uh...

13
00:00:42,761 --> 00:00:44,281
"Slavery."

14
00:00:45,931 --> 00:00:50,421
Uh, "1619." Your name at the top.
That's all you.

15
00:00:51,603 --> 00:00:53,263
(Penny:)You are such an ass.

16
00:00:53,471 --> 00:00:56,531
This is why I didn't wanna tell you
I was taking a class.

17
00:00:56,775 --> 00:00:58,335
(Leonard:)Please, don't be upset. I just...

